{"about_the_game":"Claw your way through the abyss of the mind and survive the horrors that stalk you as you attempt to survive seven days as... an Indie Developer.<br />\r\nMake It Indie! is an indie game about making an indie game. It is up to you to make tough choices about your indie game while also managing your schedule. Will you crunch to oblivion, ignoring the world around you? Or will you risk it all for a much needed break?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake It Indie features:<br />\r\n\u2022 Over 30 minutes of HD videos that immerses the player in the life of an indie developers.<br />\r\n\u2022 An intuitive gameplay experience.<br />\r\n\u2022 Multiple unique endings.<br />\r\n\u2022 Truly diverse music tracks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nP.S. Don't take this game too seriously!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good ending!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/ce8f2558fdd7d383def078b83481c3176ff1394c.jpg"},{"name":"Bad ending!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/72dce6f97b8a34644d2f2055d474b4b0882bd250.jpg"},{"name":"Woody Allen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea4c8c1f641e8cfa972085ee9e6fbdd2d03c765.jpg"},{"name":"Socrates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea4c8c1f641e8cfa972085ee9e6fbdd2d03c765.jpg"},{"name":"Eleanor Roosevelt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea4c8c1f641e8cfa972085ee9e6fbdd2d03c765.jpg"},{"name":"Pablo Picasso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea4c8c1f641e8cfa972085ee9e6fbdd2d03c765.jpg"},{"name":"Jim Rohn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea4c8c1f641e8cfa972085ee9e6fbdd2d03c765.jpg"},{"name":"Vince Lombardi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/357900/cea